description:
Read or set Jukka's Nest thermostat.

Recipes:
  - Set cooling to 75F:    {"mode": "COOL", "target_temperature": 75}
  - Set heating to 68F:    {"mode": "HEAT", "target_temperature": 68}
  - Just change setpoint:  {"target_temperature": 72}     (mode unchanged)
  - Turn off:              {"mode": "OFF"}
  - Read current state:    {}                                (no args)

Fields:
  - `mode`: HEAT, COOL, or OFF (uppercase). Omit to leave unchanged.
  - `target_temperature`: Fahrenheit number. Omit to leave unchanged.
